#. <CLT 4>食堂にやって来ると、
#. そこには、すでに数人が集まっていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A few people had already gathered at the dining hall\n"
"by the time I got there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やぁ、おはよう苗木くん！
#. 聞いてくれ、今朝は僕が１番乗りだったんだぞ！
msgctxt "0002 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Hello Makoto, and good morning! Can you believe it? I\n"
"was the very first one here this morning!"
msgstr ""

#. えへへ…おはようございますぅ…
msgctxt "0003 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Ehehe...good morning."
msgstr ""

#. おっはー！！
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Mornin'!"
msgstr ""

#. 早いな…
msgctxt "0005 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I suppose I'm early..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初から揃っている彼らは、
#. “規則正しい高校生”に分類される面々。<CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I figured everyone who had arrived on time could be\n"
"considered model high schoolers.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>で、少し遅れて来るのが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the ones who showed up a little late...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. うっす…
msgctxt "0008 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Yo."
msgstr ""

#. ごめーん、メイクに時間かかって遅れちゃった～！
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Sorry I'm late! My make-up just would NOT cooperate\n"
"this morning!"
msgstr ""

#. いやはや遅れて申し訳ありませんな。
#. 朝のお勤めを思いのほか堪能してしまいまして…
msgctxt "0010 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"My apologies, ladies and gentlemen. My morning, ah,\n"
"duty took a little longer than usual..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>多少ルーズな時間感覚の面々。
#. 大半の高校生が、この部類に入るだろう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...were the types with a more relaxed sense of time.\n"
"Most high schoolers fall into this category.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…で、散々、人を待たせた挙句に、
#. ようやくやって来るのが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And finally, the ones who kept everyone waiting\n"
"forever...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …遅くなったわね。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...I suppose I'm late."
msgstr ""

#. みなさん、おはようございます。
msgctxt "0014 | CELES"
msgid "Good morning, everyone."
msgstr ""

#. わりぃ、わりぃ…寝坊しちった！！
msgctxt "0015 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "My bad, guys! Slept right through my alarm!"
msgstr ""

#. …な、何よ…遅れて悪い？
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What? Is it s-so awful to be l-late?"
msgstr ""

#. 寝坊じゃねーって。道に迷っただけだべ。
#. 実際、バミューダトライアングルの仕業だべ。
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I didn't oversleep, just so you know. Nope, got lost!\n"
"I blame the Bermuda Triangle..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間はおろか、他人の事さえ気にしない、
#. マイペースな連中だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...don't care about time or other people in general.\n"
"They're the kind to move at their own pace.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…こうして、ボクらは全員が揃う。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But regardless, everyone had arrived.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつもなら、そのはずなのだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>At least, that's how it was supposed to go...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おや？　まだ揃っていないな…？
msgctxt "0021 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Wait, aren't we still missing some people?"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園ちゃんと十神が来てないね…
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, Sayaka and Byakuya aren't here yet."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンはともかく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't know about Byakuya, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんは、本来なら、
#. 規則正しい高校生の部類に入るはずなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I would definitely put Sayaka in the \"model high\n"
"schooler\" category.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その彼女が…まだ来てないなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So for her to be so late...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どうした？　何かあったか？
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...What's going on? Did something happen?"
msgstr ""

#. …おぅ、十神！
#. オメェ、舞園を見なかったか？
msgctxt "0027 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Hey man! Have you seen Sayaka?"
msgstr ""

#. …俺が知る訳ないだろう。
#. 今、自分の部屋からここに来た所なんだ。
msgctxt "0028 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Why would I have? I just came straight from my room to\n"
"here."
msgstr ""

#. 朝食の約束…忘れているのですかね？
msgctxt "0029 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Did she forget about our breakfast promise...?"
msgstr ""

#. しっかり者の…彼女が？
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I got the sense she always has her stuff together..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなの会話を聞くにつれ、
#. ボクの中で芽生えた小さな胸騒ぎは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Listening to everyone talk like that, a small, dark\n"
"speck of unease rose up inside of me.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…次第に大きく膨らんでいった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that speck started to grow quickly...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ボ、ボク…ちょっと…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I need to go..."
msgstr ""

#. 様子を見て来る…！
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I have to check on her!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>言い終わるや否や、
#. ボクは廊下に飛び出していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The words had barely left my lips before I flew out\n"
"into the hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
